&lt;li&gt;Supporting internal credit training and knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over time the role may include&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;line management responsibilities within the credit team.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
