&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Client Operations Manager is accountable for the day-to-day running of the Client Operations function at Triple Point. This person keeps the team productive, processes controlled, and clients served. Acting as the senior escalation point for issues, the lead on continuous improvement, and the primary bridge between operational delivery and leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
