&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Directly manage the Investor Ops and Transfer Ops teams; set clear expectations, monitor performance, and support development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run regular 1:1s, team meetings, and performance reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage capacity across the team, maintain headcount planning and workload balance in response to pipeline and project demands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a culture of ownership, accuracy, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process &amp;amp; Controls&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own operational processes end-to-end: ensure procedures are documented, followed, and fit for purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a robust control environment; identify gaps and drive remediation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor quality and accuracy of output across the teams; hold the bar on standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure regulatory and compliance obligations embedded in operations are met consistently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively identify opportunities to use technology and AI tools to streamline processes, reduce manual effort, reduce incident rates and improve accuracy, driving adoption across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Escalation &amp;amp; Issue Resolution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
