&lt;li&gt;Triage, own, and resolve problems quickly. Root-cause analysis and clear communication to affected stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in maintaining the incident dashboard; track resolution and feed learnings back into process improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPI &amp;amp; Capacity Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
