&lt;li&gt;Produce management information packs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify trends in data; proactively flag risks or capacity pressures before they become problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Projects &amp;amp; Change Implementation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to operational change projects, including but not limited to, system upgrades, process redesigns, regulatory change, or business growth initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the team is ready to embed any operational changes affecting their processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with the Projects &amp;amp; Governance team &amp;amp; Head of Client Transformation to drive continuous improvement: identify inefficiencies, and implement solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure operational readiness for new products and material updates to existing ones, facilitating training and ensuring the team is fully prepared before go-live.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with the Investor &amp;amp; Transaction Ops teams to ensure that any initial issues to new or updated processes are logged, reviewed and resolved before they become a larger issue, taking ownership of embedding change across the department.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate operational performance, risks, and changes clearly to senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage adviser/client-facing escalations where required, maintaining Triple Point&#39;s service standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a key liaison between Operations and key internal stakeholders (including but not limited to, Distribution, Digital &amp;amp; Tech, Legal, Risk &amp;amp; Compliance, Company Secretarial) ensuring smooth handoffs and consistent client experience across the investor lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a key liaison between Operations and key external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Operations in cross-functional forums and working groups, balancing the needs of front-office and support functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
