&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience managing distressed lending, restructuring or recoveries within private credit, commercial banking, direct lending or restructuring advisory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of commercial lending structures, including senior secured, asset-backed and property-backed lending.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience developing and executing restructuring and recovery strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience presenting complex restructuring cases to Credit Committees or equivalent governance forums.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience negotiating and executing loan documentation, ideally to LMA standard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial judgement and ability to balance recovery outcomes with ongoing customer relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and negotiation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong financial analysis capability including cashflow forecasting, business viability assessment and downside analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
