&lt;p&gt;Scopely is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Director of Product, Features &lt;/strong&gt;to lead the features teams for &lt;strong&gt;Star Trek Fleet Command&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;based in Spain, Ireland or the UK.&lt;/p&gt;
