&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are&amp;nbsp;seeking&amp;nbsp;a motivated and experienced&amp;nbsp;Senior, Enterprise-focused&amp;nbsp;Sales Development Representative (SDR) with&amp;nbsp;direct experience in payments or embedded finance, and a proven&amp;nbsp;track record&amp;nbsp;of generating pipeline within large, complex enterprise accounts&amp;nbsp;to join our growing sales team. In this role, you will be instrumental in driving top-of-funnel growth&amp;nbsp;across our largest and most strategic accounts&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;identifying&amp;nbsp;and engaging new prospects, building meaningful relationships, and qualifying high-quality, high-value&amp;nbsp;opportunities for our sales pipeline.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
